      <title>US Must Prepare for Rising AI Threats and Cybercrime</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-15/us-must-prepare-for-rising-ai-threats-and-cybercrime</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">c4e708143cb7f62de4685abf</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:00:10 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>It started as a win for the good guys. In October, two cybersecurity firms disclosed that they had used advanced AI models to uncover critical flaws in PHP, a programming language that underpins 70% of the internet. They had then worked quietly for weeks to help develop fixes before going public.</description>
