    <item>
      <title>Democrats Should Call Trump’s Bluff on Immigration</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-15/democrats-should-call-trump-s-bluff-on-immigration</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">5aa726a88678e9aba4099cfa</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:00:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>In casting their ballots for Democrats, voters couldn’t have been clearer about their disgust with Republican Party priorities — including, as even President Donald Trump has admitted, his administration’s overzealous approach to immigration enforcement. “It might be too tough,” he told 60 Minutes last Sunday. Yet Trump has been anything but clear when asked what he plans to do about it.</description>
